\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  God reveals His presence:
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0 Let us now adore Him.
\par And with awe appear before Him.
\par God is in His temple:
\par All within keep silence,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Prostrate lie with deepest reverence.
\par Him alone
\par God we own,
\par Him our God and Saviour:
\par Praise His Name for ever.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. God reveals His presence:
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0\qj Hear the harps resounding,
\par See the crowds the throne surrounding;
\par Holy, holy, holy!
\par Hear the hymn ascending,
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0\qj Angels, saints, their voices blending.
\par Bow Thine ear
\par To us here;
\par Hearken, O Lord Jesus,
\par To our meaner praises.
\par \pard\li315\sl186\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  O Thou Fount of blessing
\par \pard\li315\sl186\slmult0 Purify my spirit,
\par Trusting only in Thy merit:
\par Like the holy angels
\par Who behold thy glory,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par May I ceaselessly adore Thee,
\par Let Thy will
\par Ever still
\par Rule Thy Church terrestrial,
\par \pard     As the hosts celestial.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

